    "executive_summary": "This bank marketing dataset presents a significant challenge due to severe class imbalance in the target variable 'y' (88.7% 'no' vs 11.3% 'yes'). Furthermore, the critical feature 'duration' poses a high risk of target leakage and must be excluded or handled carefully during training. The data exhibits extreme multicollinearity among macroeconomic indicators (emp.var.rate, euribor3m, nr.employed), suggesting redundancy. Successful modeling will require robust imbalance handling techniques and careful feature selection to manage leakage and multicollinearity.",
