    "potential_issues_and_warnings": "The primary issue is the high risk of target leakage associated with the 'duration' column, which measures the length of the last contact and is only known post-outcome. Severe class imbalance requires specific mitigation strategies. Multicollinearity among the macroeconomic indicators is extreme and could destabilize linear models or inflate variance. Several categorical features (`default`, `marital`, `education`, `housing`, `loan`) contain 'unknown' values, which must be treated as a distinct category or imputed.",
